<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi port handles 40,179 tonnes cargo.</title>
<headline>Karachi port handles 40,179 tonnes cargo.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Karachi Port Trust said it had handled 40,179 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours to 0200 GMT on Monday compared with 25,370 tonnes in the same period on Sunday.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>				    Monday	March 2</p>
<p>    Export cargo		 5,704	14,948</p>
<p>    Import cargo		34,475	10,422</p>
<p>In the past 24 hours, five ships sailed and seven berthed.</p>
<p>In the next 24 hours, four are expected to sail and 10 are expected to arrive.</p>
</text>
